4010373442970_643687665859939817_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hQ0v6-7vGa8Q7kNvwFYULlu&_nc_oc=AdrpztXDqVVoNkW_76YiP4K1y3hGvzpfAl_m66shrSXG4ofVl4lSeDL-X5MMxVFEtA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFRRvZPSl9SdpryHTHG776rNJNRm9RXWAMhrsx4OhfvMA&oe=6A85A58D"}, "display_name": "ROLLERCOASTER, Hades' Wrath", "keywords": ["rollercoaster", "fantasy", "greekmythology", "kidfriendly", "bestselling"], "long_description": "The BEST SELLING rollercoaster is here! Transport yourself to the land of Greek mythology on a rollercoaster ride you\u2019ll never forget.\n\nSpeed off on a rollercoaster journey like no other. Visit the Temple of Poseidon, the River Styx, Tartarus, and the Palace of Hades, by zipping up and down daring drops and twists.\n\nRollerCoaster Legends is a mythology based rollercoaster featuring icons from Greek mythology, including the Minotaur, Kronos, Charon, and Hades. Enjoy the thrills of a gigantic rollercoaster.\n\nA non-stop adventure, ROLLERCOASTER Hades' Wrath delivers an unbelievable experience you will never forget. \n\n", "short_description": "The BEST SELLING rollercoaster is here! Transport yourself to the land of Greek mythology on a rollercoaster ride you\u2019ll never forget.\n\nSpeed off on a rollercoaster journey like no other. Visit the Temple of Poseidon, the River Styx, Tartarus, and the Palace of Hades, by zipping up and down daring drops and twists.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arcticwolvesgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Arctic Wolves Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.arcticwolvesgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}], "external_s